    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596760/extras/0e0a488352164d4e60c9e30b3a20427e.poster.avif?t=1694724147\" width=484 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596760/extras/0e0a488352164d4e60c9e30b3a20427e.webm?t=1694724147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596760/extras/0e0a488352164d4e60c9e30b3a20427e.mp4?t=1694724147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf11 About the Game \ud83c\udf11</strong><br><i>Inside</i> beckons you to journey through an enigmatic, shadow-laden forest. Here, it's not just the surroundings that induce fear, but the very tricks your mind plays on you. The boundaries blur between reality and illusion, crafting an unparalleled psychological horror experience.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay \ud83c\udfae</strong><br>This isn't your typical adventure. In this realm, your flashlight becomes your sole beacon and defense. You won't directly confront the lurking threats, but you'll hear them \u2014 footsteps, whispers, the chilling proximity of the unknown.<br><br><strong>\u23f0 Duration \u23f0</strong><br>The demo promises an immersive experience spanning 20 to 25 minutes. As the clock ticks, a path will emerge. What lies at its end? Only the brave will discover.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596760/extras/0e0a488352164d4e60c9e30b3a20427e.poster.avif?t=1694724147\" width=484 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596760/extras/0e0a488352164d4e60c9e30b3a20427e.webm?t=1694724147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596760/extras/0e0a488352164d4e60c9e30b3a20427e.mp4?t=1694724147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf11 About the Game \ud83c\udf11</strong><br><i>Inside</i> beckons you to journey through an enigmatic, shadow-laden forest. Here, it's not just the surroundings that induce fear, but the very tricks your mind plays on you. The boundaries blur between reality and illusion, crafting an unparalleled psychological horror experience.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay \ud83c\udfae</strong><br>This isn't your typical adventure. In this realm, your flashlight becomes your sole beacon and defense. You won't directly confront the lurking threats, but you'll hear them \u2014 footsteps, whispers, the chilling proximity of the unknown.<br><br><strong>\u23f0 Duration \u23f0</strong><br>The demo promises an immersive experience spanning 20 to 25 minutes. As the clock ticks, a path will emerge. What lies at its end? Only the brave will discover.",
